    "A logic gate takes binary inputs and produces one binary output. In this challenge 1 means True (on) and 0 means False (off).\n",
    "\n",
    "Complete the function logic_gate so that it returns the output (0 or 1) of the gate named in gate for the two inputs a and b.\n",
    "The gate name is one of AND, OR, NAND, NOR, XOR or XNOR, written in upper or lower case.\n",
    "The inputs a and b are always 0 or 1. The function must return an int (0 or 1), not True or False."
   ]
  },
